<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Enhancement Shamans in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our Tier 14 set is very straight in buffing our bread and butter spells <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=17364/stormstrike">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_shaman_stormstrike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormstrike</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=60103/lava-lash">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_shaman_lavalash.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lava Lash</span></a>. This elevates Stormstrike and Lava Lash to be about as strong as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=403/lightning-bolt">
