<del></del></span>Reputation Items for Enhancement Shamans in Phase 1</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As an Enhancement Shaman, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> to be able to purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89058/klaxxi-lash-of-the-winnower">
